Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.48,0:01:52.64,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1627,432)\fad(300,300)}Giant Demon Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:57.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:01:58.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,what's wrong with you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.84,0:02:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will take your body !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:19.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,That demon child destroyed my body
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and injured my Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:25.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't lured him to the extreme north
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:28.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,to use the ancient restriction that is there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:31.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I likely wouldn't have escaped this calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:42.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not only did I fail to capture Wang Lin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:44.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I was also severely injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:48.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The only thing I obtained was this celestial sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:50.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sword Spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:51.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:02:59.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,My lord, have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:00.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:02.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was forced by that person named Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:05.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I also hate him to the bones...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are certainly a strange Sword Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.24,0:03:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Most are very determined and loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your grandpa Xu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could those servant Sword Spirits compare to me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,A wise man knows whom he should follow...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This sword is no ordinary object.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Sword Spirit that possesses intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:33.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,is really rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:36.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,It would be a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:38.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,to erase it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:41.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,While my Origin Soul is merging with this body,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will seal it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:44.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,and see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you surrendered on your own...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,you shall be this old man's Sword Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't try to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.44,0:03:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,My lord, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:02.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Liguo has always been loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t dare to betray you !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:04.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I break this oath
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:06.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,let 10 000 demons pierce my heart !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll accompany me in seclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,When my Origin Soul is 50% merged with this body,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.48,0:04:15.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will settle the score with Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:24.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,When will you come to save me !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,They say the Soul Refining Sect is the most mysterious sect of Pilu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:36.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,They never actively recruit disciples,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:39.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,they only take those willing to bite the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as you pay the spirit stones on the opening day
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:44.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will get a cave for cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:49.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,A sect protection formation...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who dares trespass into our Soul Refining Sect !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:59.32,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1499,469)\fad(300,300)}Hong Maozi\NSoul Refining Sect's outer sect Elder\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior apologizes for intruding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:08.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've come to join the Soul Refining Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which sect are you from ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.88,0:05:15.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple is a rogue cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:20.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Reaching Foundation Establishment as a rogue isn't easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,But our outer disciple recruitment period ended long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:28.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come back in a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:29.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, please wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:32.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a flying sword that Junior found a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been saving it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:35.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please Senior, accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:43.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,How does this kid have such an artifact ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:47.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where did you find this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:50.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many years ago, I helped a Core Formation cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.44,0:05:53.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I protected him while he recovered from an injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:55.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,After recovering, he gifted me this sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:57.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,But disciple's cultivation is too low
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:05:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:05:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can see that you worked hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I'll make an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:05.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow me closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are many restrictions in the sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:10.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you enter one of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,As the jade slip said,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:26.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,the spiritual energy is very dense here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:28.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using so much spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:31.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,for thousands of outer disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,is truly extravagant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:36.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's exactly what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Chang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Chang !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:44.96,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1489,471)\fad(300,300)}Chang Dawei\NSoul Refining Sect's outer sect Elder\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:43.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:44.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,what are you shouting for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:49.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a junior I met on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:53.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Chang, how about you take him as an outer disciple ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:58.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since Hong Maozi asked personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.84,0:07:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,how could I refuse ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I leave him to you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:03.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I gathered 100 vengeful souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.56,0:07:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll add them to my Soul Flag and make one a primary soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:11.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once I'm done,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll come to drink with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hong Maozi never acts without benefit,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,what did you give him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:27.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,A sword
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,that a Senior gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,cave 1090 shall be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,One mid quality spirit stone per year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This cave has little spiritual energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:44.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,its vein looks depleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:49.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,may I switch to a better cave ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivators mustn't be greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your foundation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,is unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:08:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you keep this up, you will never reach Core Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:01.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,May Junior ask one more thing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:04.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's this Soul Flag Hong Maozi mentioned ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:09.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,that our sect has only 100 inner disciples ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yet it still can rival other sects of the country of Pilu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:19.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's because of Soul Flags.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:20.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are they ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:21.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Flags
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:24.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,are our sect's unique artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Their secrets are only for inner disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:31.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:33.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I fought my way into the inner sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:36.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,But since I stayed too long at early Core Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I lost my status
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:40.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,and became an outer sect elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:44.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could Senior share some insights ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not qualified yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Outer disciples compete every 3 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:55.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,A single one gets to enter the inner sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:57.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,try yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:00.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior apologizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's your name ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple's name is Qian Mu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.64,0:09:06.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I looked everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:27.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,but couldn't find a trace of his aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:30.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened to him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:39.24,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1690,475)\fad(300,300)}Outer disciples cave 803\NSoul Refining Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The lower the cave number,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:41.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,the more spiritual energy it has.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:43.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,For Hong Maozi's sake,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I gave you a Spirit Vein location.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior will repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:00.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tens of thousands of outer disciples...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.44,0:10:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But only one can enter the inner sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yet the sect spends vast resources on outers...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:10.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's their true purpose ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:14.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Surely not just helping disciples cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Spirit Vein ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:30.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1713,419)\fad(300,300)}Crystal Kun Stone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:36.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,So they use a Crystal Kun Stone to gather energy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:38.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and a spirit gathering formation to contain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,A clever way to make a false Spirit Vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:46.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if I break the restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and use the Crystal Kun Stone directly,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I should be able to reach Late stage Foundation Establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,With my current cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,breaking the restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it's worth trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.32,0:11:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:45.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:54.72,Level,,0,0,0,,{\pos(612,657)\fad(300,000)}Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.72,Level,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1498,579)\fad(300,000)}Peak Late stage
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This cave's spiritual energy is depleted...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.52,0:12:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,how Wan'er is doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:34.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only 7 years left...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.84,0:12:37.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have to speed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.68,0:12:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will find a true Spirit Vein
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:41.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,to fully break the Tea Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:43.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,and sealing mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:56.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1651,468)\fad(300,300)}Outer disciples cave 743\NSoul Refining Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:12:59.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This cave
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be the closest to the true Spirit Vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:04.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it's occupied...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:08.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:12.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:14.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,He has mediocre talent
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:19.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,but in just 3 months
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.52,0:13:22.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,he leaped from Early to Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:25.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,He either has a heaven defying artifact
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.92,0:13:29.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,or his cultivation method is very profound !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the next time we meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll have to call you fellow cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:36.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since my Origin Soul collapsed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't conceal my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:42.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since this Core Formation cultivator noticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:45.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's going to be troublesome to deal with...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:48.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This land is blessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior cultivated day and night
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.88,0:13:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,and got lucky in breakthroughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you reach Core Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:57.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will have a good chance to win
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:14:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,the sect competition in 3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:03.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you enter the inner sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,remember to visit me sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,let me warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.84,0:14:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sect competition only has one rule:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,winner takes all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as you win,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.24,0:14:19.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,life or death doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:22.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Senior for the advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.84,0:14:34.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can learn Qian Mu's cultivation method,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:37.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I may be able to re-enter the inner sect !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.52,0:14:47.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did he leave the door open ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:52.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's just a mere Foundation Establishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:54.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,killing him will be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:03.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Mu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:09.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,hand over your cultivation secrets !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if I refuse ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have no choice !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.84,0:15:14.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sect doesn't care
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.92,0:15:17.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,about the lives of outer disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.28,0:15:18.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you hand it over,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.44,0:15:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will spare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:37.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You really have good artifacts !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:40.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they'll all be mine today !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:48.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this thing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:15:58.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:15:59.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm an outer sect elder !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:01.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sect doesn't care
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,about the lives of outer disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's no way
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're just at Foundation Establishment...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:10.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you !?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not worthy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:14.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,to know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:36.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.80,0:16:42.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sen...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seal !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:58.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1694,464)\fad(300,300)}Spirit Vein mine\NSoul Refining Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.64,0:17:08.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Spirit Vein mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:10.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The spiritual energy here is so dense
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,that it creates spirit stones naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:15.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect place
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,for breaking the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:22.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fall !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going all out !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.08,0:17:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:05.08,Level,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1297,464)\fad(300,000)}Early stage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:05.08,Level,,0,0,0,,{\pos(653,403)\fad(300,000)}Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:17.88,Level,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,000)\pos(1376,503)}Middle stage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:17.88,Level,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,000)\pos(524,341)}Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:19.20,Level,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(510,478)}Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:19.20,Level,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1350,403)}Late stage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:22.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mountain exploded !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:23.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a powerful pressure !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:27.32,Level,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1539,536)\fad(100,000)}Early stage\N\NNascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:29.96,Level,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,000)\pos(1621,474)}Middle stage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:29.96,Level,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,000)\pos(297,606)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:37.28,Level,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,000)\pos(1000,474)}Peak Middle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.63,0:19:10.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.93,0:19:12.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:14.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:22.07,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:22.07,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.07,0:19:29.67,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:29.67,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.11,0:19:37.23,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.87,0:19:37.23,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:40.55,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.83,0:19:40.55,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:44.27,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.67,0:19:44.27,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:48.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.35,0:19:51.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.43,0:19:55.63,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.99,0:19:59.83,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.83,0:19:59.83,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:04.79,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:04.79,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.80,0:20:07.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:10.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:15.47,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:18.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:23.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:29.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.35,0:20:33.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.15,0:20:37.79,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.83,0:20:37.79,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.95,0:20:40.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.87,0:20:45.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:49.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:53.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.75,0:20:57.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:21:00.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.59,0:21:04.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.47,0:21:07.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.03,0:21:12.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1500}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
